# expect: registry line 6: 'anoRelStage0' collides with the emitter's reserved 'anoRelStage<n>' names under the case fold
# The relationship-write staging variables are a generated family, not one fixed name. A column
# that mangles onto a member of that family would overwrite a staged write, so the stem is
# reserved the way the twelve fixed emitter identifiers are.
n 2
col anoRelStage0 num 1 2
